PRD
Smart Shipment Tracker
Product Overview

Smart Shipment Tracker is a lightweight logistics operations portal that allows support teams and operations personnel to monitor active shipments, view shipment status, track delays, and investigate shipment exceptions.

The application is intentionally simple and designed to mimic a real Cargo & Logistics business application.

The system will provide a central dashboard showing shipment information and allow users to search, track, and investigate shipments.

Business Problem

Operations teams receive frequent customer inquiries regarding shipment status, delays, and delivery timelines.

Information is often scattered across multiple systems, making issue investigation slow and heavily dependent on experienced support personnel.

A centralized shipment tracking solution can improve operational visibility and reduce support effort.

Objectives

The application should:

Track active shipments
Display shipment statuses
Allow shipment search
Show shipment details
Highlight delayed shipments
Enable support teams to investigate shipment events
