FEATURE REQUEST (JIRA STORY)

This is what you will feed into Forge-X later.

Story ID

LOG-241

Title

Add Shipment Priority Management Capability

Business Problem

Operations teams currently cannot identify high-priority shipments from the dashboard.

Critical shipments containing urgent customer deliveries need to be tracked separately to ensure proactive monitoring and faster issue resolution.

Support teams should immediately know when a shipment requires special attention.

User Story

As an Operations User,

I want to assign and view shipment priorities,

So that I can quickly identify and monitor critical shipments.

Functional Requirements
Priority Levels

The system shall support:

Low
Medium
High
Critical
Dashboard Enhancement

Add Priority column to shipment dashboard.

Shipment Detail Enhancement

Display priority information inside shipment details page.

Search Enhancement

Allow filtering shipments by priority.

Visual Indicators

Show color badges:

Low → Gray
Medium → Blue
High → Orange
Critical → Red
Default Priority

Existing shipments should default to:

Medium

Acceptance Criteria
Scenario 1

Given a shipment with Critical priority

When user opens dashboard

Then priority is visible.

Scenario 2

Given multiple shipments

When user selects High priority filter

Then only High priority shipments are returned.

Scenario 3

Given shipment details page

When shipment is opened

Then priority information is displayed.

Scenario 4

Given existing shipment records

When feature is deployed

Then all shipments have default priority of Medium.

